    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502870/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.poster.avif?t=1751982533\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502870/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.webm?t=1751982533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502870/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.mp4?t=1751982533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a messenger, you need to return a pack of important documents from the remote town of Turow. But once you arrive, you find out that your appearance doesn't make everyone happy back there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to uncover the secrets of that gloomy place and discover what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of a small town of the early 20th century. Talk to the locals, fight the enemies, explore the town and its surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502870/extras/f07e76387ee524fa2e1e9ae01b155fb9.poster.avif?t=1751982533\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502870/extras/f07e76387ee524fa2e1e9ae01b155fb9.webm?t=1751982533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502870/extras/f07e76387ee524fa2e1e9ae01b155fb9.mp4?t=1751982533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dieselpunk alternate history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gloomy atmosphere of a faraway town</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a messenger, you need to return a pack of important documents from the remote town of Turow. But once you arrive, you find out that your appearance doesn't make everyone happy back there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to uncover the secrets of that gloomy place and discover what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of a small town of the early 20th century. Talk to the locals, fight the enemies, explore the town and its surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502870/extras/f07e76387ee524fa2e1e9ae01b155fb9.poster.avif?t=1751982533\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502870/extras/f07e76387ee524fa2e1e9ae01b155fb9.webm?t=1751982533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502870/extras/f07e76387ee524fa2e1e9ae01b155fb9.mp4?t=1751982533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dieselpunk alternate history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gloomy atmosphere of a faraway town</p></li></ul>",
